        "title": "Logic - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Logic is the formal study of **valid inference**. The field spans formal systems from Boolean\nalgebra all the way to Gödel's incompleteness results that place hard limits on what any\nconsistent system can prove."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#003",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
